        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In 2001, you were taken. And somehow, you survived.</strong><br>Over two decades later, you return to the place that should have stayed buried: <strong>Stanley’s World.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a cheerful drop-off nursery for children—where parents left their kids while they ran errands or went to work—it was abruptly shut down in 2001, just days after a string of mysterious disappearances... and the world changed forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it’s quiet. Empty. Almost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹️ <strong>Stanley Says</strong> is a first-person puzzle horror game set in the decaying remains of a once-trusted childcare center. Piece together the twisted history of <strong>Harvey Lamon</strong>, the man behind the madness, and <strong>Stanley</strong>, the smiling mascot who never really left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💀 <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore eerie environments dripping with corrupted childhood nostalgia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve dark puzzles to unlock doors, secrets, and memories long forgotten</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Stanley’s rules… or face the consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover disturbing lore through notes, tapes, and objects frozen in time from 2001</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“Stanley says… don’t look behind you.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not a kid anymore.<br>But Stanley doesn’t care.</p>",
